{"c":[{"id":"5bd4bd21978fce46","sum":"L4 milestone Ref is not a projectbrief pointer: the ticket goes on the checkbox. /niko-preflight dispatches on progress.md Complexity only. speedup-giesen is an a-la-carte skill with no ruleset: report stupid-class findings, the operator picks cuts, and that turn does not edit.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"349ba64ddd6f940e","sum":"L4 milestone Ref is not a projectbrief pointer: briefs are whole-program. Ticket goes on the checkbox; Done, Risks, and brief are the spec. /niko-preflight dispatches on progress.md Complexity only: L2/L3 default-preflight.md, L4 level4-preflight.md.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260912T175950Z-45ef02d313971bad","text":"L4 milestone Ref is not a projectbrief pointer: briefs are whole-program, not per-slice. Ticket goes on the checkbox when one exists; Done, Risks, and the brief are the spec.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260912T185216Z-0d75b4d2ed056a23","text":"L4 /niko-preflight dispatches on progress.md Complexity only (never milestones.md presence): L2/L3 default-preflight.md, L4 level4-preflight.md; spawn line unchanged; live paths need chore(dev): ai-rizz sync after PR #125 merges","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"ac31e82c9ee47581","sum":"speedup-giesen: a-la-carte skill at rules/speedup-giesen/SKILL.md (no ruleset), keyed on Giesen 2020 2x/100x tweet; audit-then-wait: report stupid-class findings, operator picks cuts, no edits in the report turn.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260913T231422Z-b6356c0b0c7eb90a","text":"speedup-giesen is an a-la-carte skill at rules/speedup-giesen/SKILL.md; opening key is Giesen 2020 2x/100x tweet; no ruleset.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260913T232538Z-077e296baa4ce7f2","text":"speedup-giesen is audit-then-wait: report stupid-class findings; operator picks which to cut; do not edit in the report turn.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"538415bcd2f7c26b","sum":"BenchLM 403s without a User-Agent; refresh sends choose-verification-model. Tiers C B A S, low to high. -fast shares the base row, appended only when the author was fast and the model has fast. grok-4.6 is tier A. Fable 5.1 high, Sol medium, Luna medium stay mapped until enabled.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"cb35ffe0772aba1b","sum":"BenchLM models.json returns 403 without a User-Agent; refresh.py sends choose-verification-model. Tiers are C B A S, lowest to highest. Fable 5.1 high, Sol medium, and Luna medium stay mapped until enabled.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260923T171433Z-ce279ab52fc62d19","text":"BenchLM models.json returns 403 without a User-Agent; refresh.py sends choose-verification-model.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260923T174149Z-3e9915921a090194","text":"Catalog tiers are C B A S lowest to highest. Fable 5.1 high, Sol medium, and Luna medium stay mapped for when they are enabled.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"dcec28cd74a2a260","sum":"choose-verification-model: -fast shares the base row and is appended only when the author was fast and the model has fast. cursor-grok-4.6-xhigh is tier A. Live claude-opus-5-5-high and grok-4.7-xhigh were unknown; catalog had opus-5-5-medium and grok-4.7-high.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260923T175126Z-b6b0ec4afd3fbaa0","text":"choose-verification-model: trailing -fast shares the base catalog row; rank on the base price; append -fast only when the author was fast and the chosen model has a fast variant.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260923T214304Z-c05ae22638162f06","text":"choose-verification-model: cursor-grok-4.6-xhigh is tier A, family grok, has_fast. Live slugs claude-opus-5-5-high and grok-4.7-xhigh are still unknown; catalog has claude-opus-5-5-medium and grok-4.7-high.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
